  "abstract": "The P parameter for \u03c0 + p scattering at 236.3 MeV has been measured between 50\u00b0 and 146\u00b0 c.m. with very low background using a butanol polarized proton target. The resulting D phases are in fair agreement with dispersion relation values.",
